(13)
"non-teaching staff" of the University or a college means the employees of the University or that college, other than
teachers;
(14)
"Prescribed" means prescribed by this Act or the Statutes, Ordinances, Regulations, rules or bye-laws made thereunder;
(15)
"principal" means the head of a college;
(16)
"private college" means a college maintained by an educational agency other than the Government or the University and
affiliated to the University; "but shall not include a college which is administered and managed by a society registered
