"Pro-Chancellor" means the Pro-Chancellor of the University;
(18)
"Pro-Vice-Chancellor" means the Pro-Vice-Chancellor of the University;
(19)
"recognised institution" means an institution for research or special studies, other than an affiliated college, recognised
as such by the University;
